t willing to further education. Need to weigh.\n\nWe can argue that A's calmness is a single note, but we need consistency. B's stress handling is documented as \"handles stress very well\". Also B's nasty remarks are concerning but could be mitigated. A's communication issues are more structural (difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric) which may be harder to mitigate. Also A not willing to further education suggests less adaptability. So we may keep B.\n\nThus we will state recommendation for Candidate B, referencing Agent 1's point about stress resilience, and Agent 3's point about A's strengths, but argue that A's communication issues are more severe than B's interpersonal remarks, and B's stress handling is more robust. Also note B's conscientiousness and technical competence.\n\nThus produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON with vote B."}
